Author: Arthur S. Courtin

This folder contains updated versions of the parameters.py script from the HRD 
toolbox and the loadParams.m script from the RRST toolbox.

The parameter ranges used by the adaptive thresholding algorithm, as well as the 
prior density in case of the RRST, have been updated based on the VMP dataset 
refit presented in: https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.08.27.672360

To use these updated scripts, replace the original files in their respective 
toolbox directories with the versions provided here.

If you use these scripts, please cite https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.08.27.672360
in addition to the original paper introducing the task.